WEBVTT

00:05:29.156 --> 00:05:30.676
can do this work,

00:05:30.716 --> 00:05:34.076
imagine the impact
that a concentrated effort

00:05:34.076 --> 00:05:37.796
by governments, scientists
and policymakers would have.

00:05:39.436 --> 00:05:40.596
Groups of people

00:05:40.636 --> 00:05:43.716
that are being disproportionately
affected by climate change

00:05:43.716 --> 00:05:46.836
deserve to have access
to the resources they need

00:05:46.836 --> 00:05:51.676
to make sense of these disasters
that are destroying their communities.

00:05:51.716 --> 00:05:58.716
(Cheers and applause)

00:05:59.116 --> 00:06:02.956
The more people are informed
about the climate crisis,